&lt;p&gt;
	At the time of inspection, we had only just hired the trailer and were in the process of setting up.&amp;nbsp; The hot water was not functioning however; the owner was contacted immediately and attended to resolve the issue, which was fixed within two hours and was due to a faulty wire on the machine which was replaced.&lt;br /&gt;
	&lt;br /&gt;
	During this period, we maintained safe practices as we always do; separate tongs, milk jugs and equipment are used for allergens; hot water was available via our coffee machine and neighbouring trailers and all equipment is returned daily to our main unit thorough dishwashing and changeover.&amp;nbsp; Hand sanitizer is always provided for hand hygiene.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	We have operate in this manner at other events and also those without our trailer present without issue and have been consistently met environmental health requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
